  m_text: "Subject: Need You to Come In \u2013 New Task\n\nHi ,\n\nI need you to
    come by my office as soon as you can today. There\u2019s a new task that just
    came up, and I\u2019d like to go over the details with you in person. It shouldn\u2019t
    take too long, but it\u2019s something we need to start working on right away.\n\nLet
    me know when you\u2019re available, or just stop by if you\u2019re already on
    campus.\n\nThanks,\nBoss"
